<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/navbar') %>

<main class="meridian-page">
  <header class="meridian-page-header">
    <div class="header-container">
      <span class="header-pre">The Maison Chronicle</span>
      <h1 class="header-main-title">About Meridian</h1>
      <div class="gold-accent-line"></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="meridian-section about-section">
    <div class="about-hero-grid">
      <div class="about-narrative">
        <span class="narrative-pre">Philosophy of the True North</span>
        <h2>Where Architecture Concurs with Couture</h2>
        <div class="gold-accent-line" style="margin: 0 0 25px 0;"></div>
        
        <p>
          Founded upon the principles of geographic equilibrium and timeless sartorial harmony, 
          <strong>Meridian</strong> represents the zenith of modern Indian and global fashion. 
          Just as a meridian circle connects the celestial poles across the earth's surface, 
          our garments bridge ancestral artisanal tradition with contemporary architectural silhouettes.
        </p>
        
        <p>
          Every fiber selected in our studio undergoes rigorous tactile curation — from Egyptian 
          Giza cotton and Tuscan vegetable-tanned leathers to handcrafted Zardozi raw silks and 
          Mongolian cashmere. We reject the fleeting transience of fast fashion, opting instead for 
          garments that endure across seasons and generations.
        </p>

        <p>
          With dedicated ateliers across Milan, Paris, New Delhi, Lyon, and Tokyo, our resident couturiers preserve ancestral hand-looming, hand-hammered bullion embroidery, and zero-waste pattern draping. We believe true luxury lies in restraint, precision, and the whisper of unmatched fabric against skin.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-image-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1445205170230-053b83016050?w=1000" alt="Meridian Atelier Workshop">
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillars of the Maison -->
    <div class="pillars-grid">
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <i class="fas fa-drafting-compass pillar-glyph"></i>
        <h3>Atelier Precision</h3>
        <p>Hand-cut patterns, double-faced cashmere seams, and bespoke canvassing perfected over hundreds of hours by master artisans.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <i class="fas fa-leaf pillar-glyph"></i>
        <h3>Ethical Provenance</h3>
        <p>Traceable raw mulberry silks, non-mulesed virgin wools, and organic certified fibers harvested with ecological reverence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <i class="fas fa-concierge-bell pillar-glyph"></i>
        <h3>White-Glove Care</h3>
        <p>Complimentary made-to-measure tailoring, climate-controlled garment preservation, and personalized worldwide concierge support.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

